sequenceDiagram
    participant ADO as Azure DevOps
    participant Poll as Polling Service
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant Event as Event Processor
    participant Bot as Teams Bot
    participant User as Teams User

    Note over Poll: Every 5 minutes
    Poll->>ADO: Query all CRs
    ADO-->>Poll: Return CR list
    
    loop For each CR
        Poll->>ADO: Get CR details
        ADO-->>Poll: CR data
        Poll->>DB: Check if CR exists
        
        alt CR exists in DB
            DB-->>Poll: Existing CR data
            Poll->>Poll: Compare states
            
            alt State changed
                Poll->>DB: Update CR
                Poll->>DB: Log to cr_state_history
                Poll->>Event: Trigger change event
                
                Event->>Event: Check event rules
                alt Rule matches (e.g., Pending CAB → Approved)
                    Event->>DB: Get creator email
                    DB-->>Event: Creator info
                    Event->>DB: Check if notification sent
                    
                    alt Not sent yet
                        Event->>DB: Get conversation reference
                        DB-->>Event: Conversation ref
                        Event->>Bot: Send proactive message
                        Bot->>User: 🔔 CR Approved notification
                        Event->>DB: Log notification sent
                    end
                end
            end
        else New CR
            Poll->>DB: Insert new CR
        end
    end
